message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "kyfan-tucker: Nullstellensatz / Sherali-Adams degree of Tucker and Ky Fan over F_2 - proofs, checks and computations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Stavrianos
    given-names: Jacob
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vatsj/kyfan-tucker"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Companion repository: mechanically checked proof components (tower certificate, extension lemma,
  explicit realization, separating functional), the exact small numbers (minimum certificate size 304
  at degree 3 on S^2; per-flag hitting numbers t = 8 on S^2 and t >= 12 on S^3; degree-4 search profile),
  and the Glauber-dynamics evidence for the Spread Lemma.
